{"ID":"20230925154346-6qyp4vf","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20230925154346-6qyp4vf","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230925154346-6qyp4vf\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230925154354-erxx71f\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230925154354-v5t5l11\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230925154356-1nyyh3u\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:0\u0026#125;","title":"【越婢加术汤】","type":"doc","updated":"20230925154356"},"Children":[{"ID":"20230925154354-erxx71f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925154354-erxx71f","updated":"20230925154354"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"组成：麻黄六两、石膏半斤，生姜三两、甘草二两、白术四两、大枣十五枚"}]},{"ID":"20230925154354-uadb36b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925154354-uadb36b","updated":"20230925154354"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"上六味，以水六升，先煮麻黄去沫，内诸药，煮取三升，分温三服，恶风加附子一枚，炮。"}]},{"ID":"20230925154356-1nyyh3u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925154356-1nyyh3u"}},{"ID":"20230925154354-v5t5l11","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925154354-v5t5l11","updated":"20230925154354"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《千金方》越婢加术汤：治肉极，热则身体津脱，腠理开，汗大泄，厉风气，下焦脚弱。"}]}]}